---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Zachary Carter | Elect Zachary Carter for Justice of the Peace, Precinct 2"
  description="Learn about Zachary Carter, a lifelong Bastrop County resident with 19 years of experience in corrections, law enforcement, Municipal and Justice Court."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="block-navy section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="editorial-rule-white mb-6"></div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm tracking-[0.2em] text-red mb-4">MEET YOUR CANDIDATE</div>
          <h1 class="text-hero text-white">About<br/><span class="text-red">Zachary</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="border-[3px] border-white/20 overflow-hidden">
            <img src="/assets/Headshot.jpg" alt="Zachary Carter, candidate for Justice of the Peace" class="w-full h-auto block" loading="eager" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bio -->
  <section class="block-white section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-8">Deep Roots in<br/>Bastrop County</h2>

      <div class="text-editorial text-ink-light space-y-6">
        <p>
          Bastrop County has been my home since childhood, and today I'm proud to be raising my family in the same community I've served for nearly two decades. Over the past 19 years, my career has spanned Corrections, service as a Deputy Sheriff, and judicial experience as both Associate Judge for the City of Smithville and Justice of the Peace for Precinct 2.
        </p>

        <div class="red-bar-left my-10">
          <blockquote class="font-body text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink italic leading-snug">
            "As Justice of the Peace, I serve at the entry level of the judiciary, presiding over both criminal and civil cases."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="font-display text-sm tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-light mt-4">ZACHARY CARTER</div>
        </div>

        <p>
          I perform magistrate duties ensuring individuals are informed of their rights, setting bail, and establishing conditions that help protect victims and the wider community. I also fulfill the statutory responsibilities of a coroner.
        </p>
        <p>
          My professional background, strengthened by my educational qualifications, reflects a lifelong commitment to fairness, accountability, and public service. Together, these experiences position me as a strong and capable candidate for this office.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Education -->
  <section class="block-bone section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-10">Education</h2>

      <div class="space-y-0">
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2025</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Blinn College</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Criminal Justice, Associate of Arts (AA)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2024</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Texas Municipal Court Education Center</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">New Judge School, Austin</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2023 - 2024</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Texas Justice Court Training Center</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">New Judge School, Texas State University</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2021</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">CAPCOG Basic Peace Officer Course</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Hutto Police Department</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2007</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">CAPCOG Basic Jailer Course</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Bastrop County Sheriff's Office</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2005 - 2006</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Blinn College</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Majored in Criminal Justice</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2004</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Victoria College</div>
            <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Major Criminal Justice</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy bg-navy p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-3 sm:gap-6">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.15em] whitespace-nowrap pt-1">2004</div>
          <div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-white">Smithville High School</div>
            <div class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm">Graduate</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Experience -->
  <section class="block-white section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-10">Experience</h2>

      <div class="space-y-0 mb-14">
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy bg-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-1">
            <div class="font-display text-lg text-white">Bastrop County Justice of the Peace Precinct #2</div>
            <div class="inline-block bg-red px-3 py-1 font-display text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white self-start">CURRENT</div>
          </div>
          <div class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm">Judge · August 2023 - Present</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Smithville Municipal Court</div>
          <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">Associate Municipal Judge · January 2024 - Present</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-lg text-ink">Bastrop County Sheriff's Office</div>
          <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm">County Corrections Officer / Deputy Sheriff · October 2007 - August 2023</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Current Responsibilities -->
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-8">Current Responsibilities</h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-0 mb-14">
        <!-- Civil Law -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">CIVIL LAW</div>
          <ul class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm space-y-2">
            <li>Small claims hearings up to $20,000</li>
            <li>Debt claims hearings up to $20,000</li>
            <li>Eviction hearings</li>
            <li>Administrative hearings:
              <ul class="ml-4 mt-1 space-y-1 text-ink-light/80">
                <li>Disposition of stolen/recovered property</li>
                <li>Handgun denial suspension</li>
                <li>Driver's license suspension / Occupational licensing</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Criminal Law -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 md:border-t-[3px] border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">CRIMINAL LAW</div>
          <ul class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm space-y-2">
            <li>Class C misdemeanor offenses & Juvenile Hearings</li>
            <li>Arrest warrants</li>
            <li>Magistrate duties:
              <ul class="ml-4 mt-1 space-y-1 text-ink-light/80">
                <li>Rights warnings of Art. 15.17 Texas CCP</li>
                <li>Setting bail and fine amounts</li>
                <li>Ordering bond conditions</li>
                <li>Emergency Protective Orders</li>
                <li>Applications for court appointed attorney</li>
                <li>Mental Health assessment</li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Other Law -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-6 md:p-8 md:col-span-2">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">OTHER LAW</div>
          <div class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-2">
            <span>Inquests</span>
            <span>Weddings</span>
            <span>Notary</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Previous Job Responsibilities -->
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink mb-8">Previous Responsibilities</h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
        <!-- Corrections -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">CORRECTIONS</div>
          <ul class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm space-y-2">
            <li>Assist Magistrate with Inmate magistration</li>
            <li>Transporting inmates to court hearings</li>
            <li>Supervising Jail Transport</li>
            <li>Inmate custody assessments and classifications</li>
            <li>Compliance on Jail Use of Force incidents</li>
            <li>Monthly reports to the Texas Commission on Jail Standards</li>
            <li>Oversee procedures in the booking and releasing</li>
            <li>Scheduling for Jail training, Officer Assignments, and inmate transports</li>
            <li>Field Training Coordinator</li>
            <li>Jail Academy Instructor</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Patrol Deputy -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 md:border-t-[3px] border-navy p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">PATROL DEPUTY</div>
          <ul class="font-body text-ink-light text-sm space-y-2">
            <li>Execute warrants</li>
            <li>Document and secure crime scenes</li>
            <li>Answer calls for assistance</li>
            <li>Traffic enforcement</li>
            <li>Crash scene investigation</li>
            <li>DWI investigation</li>
            <li>Notify and assist Justice of the Peace with inquest</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Awards & Honors -->
  <section class="block-bone section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-10">Awards &<br/><span class="text-red">Honors</span></h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0">
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2007</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Basic Jailer Certification</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 sm:border-l-0 border-t-0 sm:border-t-[3px] border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2008</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Rookie of the Year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 md:border-t-[3px] border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2010</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Field Training Officer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2011</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Jailer of the Year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 sm:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2011</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Promotion to Jail Corporal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2013</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Promotion to Jail Sergeant</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2013</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Intermediate Jailer Certification</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 sm:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2013</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Advanced Jailer Certification</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2018</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Field Training Coordinator</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2018</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Jail Division Employee of the Year</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 sm:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2019</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Promotion to Jail Lieutenant</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy p-5">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2021</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-ink mt-1">Peace Officer</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy bg-navy p-5 sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-3">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-xs tracking-[0.15em]">2022</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm text-white mt-1">Master Jailer Certification</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Career Timeline -->
  <section class="block-white section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-14">19 Years of<br/>Dedicated Service</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
        <!-- Corrections -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-navy p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-2">01 · CORRECTIONS</div>
          <div class="font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-4">WHERE IT<br/>BEGAN</div>
          <p class="text-editorial text-ink-light">
            Zachary began his career in corrections, gaining ground-level understanding of the criminal justice system. This experience provided critical insight into rehabilitation, consequences, and the human side of justice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Law Enforcement -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 md:border-t-[3px] border-navy p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-2">02 · LAW ENFORCEMENT</div>
          <div class="font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-4">PROTECTING<br/>THE COMMUNITY</div>
          <p class="text-editorial text-ink-light">
            Serving in law enforcement deepened Zachary's knowledge of criminal procedure, constitutional rights, and public safety. He protected and served while building the legal expertise essential for a Justice of the Peace.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Municipal Court -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-t-0 border-navy p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-2">03 · MUNICIPAL COURT</div>
          <div class="font-display text-4xl text-ink mb-4">INSIDE THE<br/>COURTROOM</div>
          <p class="text-editorial text-ink-light">
            Municipal court experience gave Zachary direct exposure to civil proceedings, court administration, and serving the public within a judicial setting, managing dockets while ensuring everyone was treated fairly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Justice Court -->
        <div class="border-[3px] border-l-0 md:border-l-0 border-t-0 border-navy bg-navy text-white p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-red text-sm tracking-[0.2em] mb-2">04 · JUSTICE COURT</div>
          <div class="font-display text-4xl mb-4">READY TO<br/>LEAD</div>
          <div class="inline-block bg-red px-3 py-1 font-display text-sm tracking-[0.15em] mb-4">CURRENT</div>
          <p class="text-white/70 font-body">
            Zachary's current experience in the Justice Court system means he already understands the day-to-day operations, challenges, and responsibilities. He's not learning on the job. He's ready from day one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="block-navy section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule-white mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-white mb-14">What I<br/><span class="text-red">Stand For</span></h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 border-[3px] border-white/20">
        <div class="border-b-[3px] md:border-b-0 md:border-r-[3px] border-white/20 p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-6xl text-red mb-4">⚖️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl text-white mb-3">Fair Justice</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm">Every person who enters the courtroom deserves to be heard and treated with dignity, regardless of circumstance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b-[3px] md:border-b-0 md:border-r-[3px] border-white/20 p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-6xl text-white mb-4">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl text-white mb-3">Community First</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm">Bastrop County raised me, and I'm committed to giving back through service that puts our community's needs first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 md:p-10">
          <div class="font-display text-6xl text-red mb-4">🛡️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl text-white mb-3">Integrity Always</h3>
          <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-sm">19 years of public service built on honesty, transparency, and doing what's right, not what's easy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo Gallery -->
  <section class="block-white section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="editorial-rule mb-6"></div>
      <h2 class="text-section text-ink mb-10">Community &<br/>Campaign</h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-1">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/Headshot.jpg" alt="Zachary Carter official campaign headshot" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/2.png" alt="Zachary Carter being sworn in at Bastrop County courthouse" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/4.png" alt="Zachary Carter in sheriff uniform with his child" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/jZbvNz8cRxODPBULevs6gA.jpg" alt="Zachary Carter in uniform at the Texas State Capitol" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/IMG_2586.jpg" alt="Zachary Carter and team at a community volunteer event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden">
          <img src="/assets/001KeepZachary_PCard_6x4_PRINT_Page_1.jpg.png" alt="Zachary Carter campaign card with family" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="block-red section-pad">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-section text-white mb-6">Support the Campaign</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline-white" id="about-cta">
          Get Involved →
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61593585525908" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-white">
          Follow on Facebook
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
